Clawd firmware (clawd-home)

This firmware began as a fork of smalltv-mod by giovi321
(https://github.com/giovi321/smalltv-mod), released under the WTFPL, and
carries the Clawd usage screens ported from Clawdmeter by Hermann Bjorgvin and
contributors (https://github.com/HermannBjorgvin/Clawdmeter). Upstream
Clawdmeter carries no license file; credit and thanks go to its authors.

